@AsgardArru I just find it interesting that everyone likes to use the Warren Buffett quote: "Be greedy when others are fearful"

But when a crash actually happens, everyone makes fun of folks like Morgan Stanley when they say "Maximum Overweight"

Not saying I agree with this positioning, but I just found their stance interesting enough to share.

